1
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:06,000
Taming The Husband

2
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:09,000
Episode 10

3
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,840
Mingpei.

4
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:21,760
Mingpei.

5
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,480
You walk without making a sound?

6
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,000
Lady Jin is feeling unwell.

7
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:38,840
The physician sent me
to fetch the medicine for her.

8
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,040
Where is the head maid?

9
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:42,600
She is out.

10
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,160
What a coincidence.

11
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:48,160
Madam Zhou told the kitchen to prepare
plum drink this morning

12
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:51,320
to help Lady Jin beat the heat.

13
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:57,440
I haven't had the chance to deliver it.

14
00:01:58,200 --> 00:02:00,240
Second Young Master
also mentioned it yesterday.

15
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,920
The chefs all remember.

16
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:05,080
Since you're here, take it back with you.

17
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:11,880
Great.

18
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:14,600
The iced drink is Lady Jin's favorite.

19
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,160
Madam Zhou is thoughtful.

20
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,400
Go on then.

21
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,000
How is it?

22
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,280
Nothing seems wrong.

23
00:02:39,040 --> 00:02:42,360
Told you. Who would be so stupid
as to poison someone openly?

24
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,520
I'm parched.

25
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,040
It's delicious. Try some.

26
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,360
It is.

27
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:05,240
But why would they send anything
all of a sudden?

28
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:09,400
I find it strange.
Why are you so wary of her?

29
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,600
You don't know.

30
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:29,720
Second Young Master's biological mother
was the Minister of Revenue's daughter.

31
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:35,560
I heard that Madam Ye fell from a tree
while retrieving a kite and died.

32
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:38,600
Just three months after her death,
Madam Zhou married in.

33
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,720
Soon after, she had
Fourth Young Master.

34
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:46,640
Moreover, Madam Zhou and Madam Ye
were close friends.

35
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:50,320
So rumor has it the kite was just a cover.

36
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:52,960
Madam Zhou seduced
Second Master first.

37
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,080
Madam Ye was so angry that…

38
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:57,920
Who would've thought? I had no idea.

39
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:01,240
It's hardly something to boast about.
Best keep it quiet.

40
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:10,600
The Xie ancestral hall

41
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,240
Where are my aunts?

42
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:28,480
Madam Zhou is looking
after the salt shop.

43
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,760
She asked my mother to help out.

44
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:34,000
Seems like Aunt Zhou is upset.

45
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,920
Our "heroine" is already putting on airs.

46
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,880
She even has the nerve to be late.

47
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,080
What time is it now?

48
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:44,720
We might miss the auspicious time.

49
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,400
Perhaps…

50
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:48,920
something came up.

51
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,680
Let's wait a bit longer.

52
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:56,560
Yan, why isn't my sister-in-law here?

53
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,720
You started calling her that?

54
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:04,520
That's not the point. She isn't here.
Why didn't you bring her?

55
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:15,480
No matter how great her contributions,
it's her first ancestral rite.

56
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,200
How dare she keep the ancestors waiting?

57
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,640
This is pure disrespect.

58
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:22,680
Whether one is respectful or not,
the ancestors will be the judge.

59
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:26,800
Some only pay lip service,
while others keep it in their hearts.

60
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:34,640
Yingtao was feeling unwell this morning.

61
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,840
That's why I was delayed.

62
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,360
Madam, I beg for your forgiveness.

63
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:41,240
Is a mere lowly servant
more important than our ancestors?

64
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:43,600
If I can't cherish those around me,

65
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:46,680
how can I honor ancestors far away?

66
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:47,840
Enough.

67
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,240
Stop talking.

68
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:50,480
Offer the incense.

69
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:59,640
Casting divination blocks
is a tradition passed down.

70
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:02,160
Fortune is never certain.

71
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,880
It is meant to bring good luck.

72
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,720
After all, it is an ancestral rite.

73
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,400
We must never neglect it.

74
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:18,440
Memorial tablet of Lady Qian
of the Xie family,

75
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:22,000
Ancestors, I humbly ask for your guidance.

76
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,800
The family has discussed this,

77
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:27,680
and we believe the eldest grandson,
Xie Yan, is up to the task.

78
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,760
We dare not decide on our own

79
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:33,920
and humbly seek your approval.

80
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:23,160
With all my sincerity,

81
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,600
-I petition you, ancestors.
-Please reconsider, Mother.

82
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:28,280
Three consecutive Yin throws
already show the will of Heaven.

83
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,200
We must not cast them again.

84
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,640
Mother.

85
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:36,480
Those who dare not shoulder the burden
should not ask for Heaven's will.

86
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:39,640
Only those who dare to brave
life and death may seek Heaven's blessing.

87
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,720
You…

88
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:43,000
Please grant me one more throw, Madam.

89
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,840
You're risking the family's fate

90
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,000
to settle your own.

91
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:50,480
You dare to take the burden,
but you can't afford the cost.

92
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:54,360
The Xie family can afford it,
but we choose not to.

93
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:14,840
I'll bear any consequence.

94
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,960
Please let her ask Heaven once more.

95
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,000
Cast the blocks.

96
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,720
Heaven, we're doomed.

97
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:02,240
What are we going to do?

98
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,560
This--

99
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,320
What are you doing?

100
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,600
There are four possible outcomes
with each casting.

101
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:11,280
One Yin result is one in four.

102
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:13,840
Two in a row is one in sixteen.

103
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:16,600
Three in a row is one in sixty-four.

104
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:17,960
Four in a row

105
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:20,000
is one in two hundred and fifty-six.

106
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:22,520
That's precisely why
it manifests Heaven's will.

107
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:23,760
Let go of my mother!

108
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,880
Let go of me!

109
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,840
But this is not a mere matter of chance.

110
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:30,040
The Yangtze River never flows west
and the Big Dipper never shifts.

111
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:36,000
Likewise, those with ill intentions
would never sit idly by.

112
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,160
Why is it so small yet so heavy?

113
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:47,680
There is lead inside!

114
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,160
Someone must tamper with it.

115
00:09:50,640 --> 00:09:51,640
Who is it?

116
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:59,400
A small leak can sink a great ship.

117
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:04,280
I can turn a blind eye
to minor family squabbles.

118
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:07,480
But you've gone too far this time.

119
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:09,720
You dare gamble our family's fortune

120
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:12,320
by meddling with the divination blocks?

121
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,120
Step forward

122
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,520
and own up to it.

123
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:29,200
If I have to find out myself,

124
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:31,160
there will be no mercy.

125
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:39,680
I have something to say.

126
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,360
Yingtao.

127
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,440
Yingtao!

128
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,320
Don't worry.

129
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,480
She is out of danger.

130
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,720
However…

131
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,360
What did she consume just now?

132
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,240
This.

133
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:35,160
This is an ice cube.

134
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:37,160
With datura powder hidden in the middle.

135
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:39,600
Yesterday, Madam Zhou
sent me a pot of plum drink.

136
00:11:39,680 --> 00:11:41,160
It had many ice cubes like this.

137
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,800
Yingtao fainted
right after drinking that plum drink.

138
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:45,440
What did you say?

139
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:47,480
Madam Zhou sent it?

140
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:54,720
This is powdered datura.

141
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:57,160
It's made from the plant's flowers.

142
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:59,160
It's a rare herb from the southwest.

143
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:00,600
It has medicinal uses.

144
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:02,800
But it is toxic
and must be used in small doses.

145
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:05,640
Concealed in ice,
the poison leaves no trace at first.

146
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:06,720
Once the ice melts,

147
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:09,200
the drink becomes lethal.

148
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:11,520
Many cough medicines react badly with it.

149
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:14,720
You've had a cough
and have been recuperating, haven't you?

150
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:16,680
She just said

151
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:18,600
Madam Zhou sent it as a gift.

152
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,160
It's an ingenious method,

153
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,960
but it's not foolproof.

154
00:12:25,280 --> 00:12:26,760
Mother has always been cautious.

155
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:29,800
And we've never had any issues with her.

156
00:12:30,160 --> 00:12:31,800
What if she did the opposite

157
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,600
on purpose?

158
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:36,040
She's quite patient.

159
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,800
Hasn't shown her true colors yet.

160
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,360
Datura's hard to get.

161
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:43,800
Father only brought back a little
and entrusted it all to Lady Qin.

162
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:46,280
He told her to distribute it
to all the courtyards.

163
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:48,040
That's right.

164
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:52,080
But I made sure yours went to you, Wanjun.

165
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:53,560
Right?

166
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:57,560
Mother, that is true.

167
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:02,240
However, I returned it to you right then.

168
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,000
Diehuan.

169
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,560
Madam,

170
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:12,160
my lady did return the datura.

171
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:16,520
You said Madam Zhou
had someone send the drink.

172
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,840
Who was it?

173
00:13:18,160 --> 00:13:20,320
Where was it delivered?
Was there a witness?

174
00:13:20,880 --> 00:13:23,480
Madam Zhou had Mingpei
take it to the storeroom

175
00:13:23,800 --> 00:13:25,520
for the head maid to give to Yingtao.

176
00:13:25,880 --> 00:13:29,080
But the head maid was on leave that day,
so Yingtao fetched it herself.

177
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:31,640
What a coincidence, right?

178
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:34,040
The divination blocks
were in the storeroom

179
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:35,360
when they were tampered with.

180
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:37,200
The plum drink went wrong

181
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:39,080
during a handover there, too.

182
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:42,360
Wanjun, I'm in charge of the household.

183
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:45,040
If you need anything, just tell me.

184
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,160
I'll get it for you.

185
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:49,120
Why send someone to get it yourself?

186
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:54,440
Mingpei,

187
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,560
bring that item here.

188
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:06,640
Mother,

189
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:09,880
I sent Mingpei to the storeroom

190
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:12,680
to get this sandalwood cane.

191
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:16,240
It is a gift for Yan.

192
00:14:16,640 --> 00:14:18,280
I know how meticulous he is,

193
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:22,120
so I wanted to take it back
and polish it a little more.

194
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:25,640
No point in hiding it now.

195
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:28,560
Here you are. Try it.

196
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:34,520
Thank you, Mother.

197
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:37,560
It'll acquire its own luster with time.

198
00:14:40,280 --> 00:14:41,800
I haven't finished yet.

199
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:44,400
The master did bring datura back

200
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:46,440
and asked me to distribute it.

201
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:50,000
I sent some to Wanjun right away,
but she returned it to me.

202
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:52,520
However, that same night,
I distributed it to everyone.

203
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:54,200
To every courtyard.

204
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:02,160
We also received it the night before.

205
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:06,640
But I… was busy and forgot about it.

206
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,360
We got our share too?

207
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:10,880
Yes.

208
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:13,000
We'd better not act rashly tomorrow,

209
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:15,120
lest we offend anyone.

210
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:16,880
Baozhu,

211
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:19,680
arrive a bit later
for tomorrow's ancestral rite.

212
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,960
My leg ailment never got better.

213
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:25,680
This medicine was the reason all along.

214
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:28,480
I burn benzoin in my room year-round,

215
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:30,960
but this medicine is mixed with moxa.

216
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:34,200
And it was the second branch
that prescribed it.

217
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:37,040
Lady Qin, since we're all here today,

218
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:39,560
I want an explanation from you.

219
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:42,000
How would I know

220
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:44,440
that you use benzoin in your room?

221
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:48,160
I thought it was a good prescription,
so I gave it to you.

222
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:51,640
Who would have thought
my good intentions would cause harm?

223
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,120
Lady Qin, you manage the house.

224
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:56,840
The expenses of every courtyard
are all overseen by you.

225
00:15:57,400 --> 00:16:00,040
My mother knows no medicine.
She meant no harm.

226
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:02,480
And it wasn't my mother
who gave him benzoin.

227
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:04,480
Find whoever gave it to him first.

228
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:05,840
They must know medicine.

229
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:07,520
He couldn't sleep
because of his leg injury.

230
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:08,760
We gave him the incense first.

231
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:09,920
You sent the medicine later.

232
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:11,320
You're trying to sow discord.

233
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:12,560
What nonsense!

234
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:13,640
-Yi.
-You--

235
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:15,640
Don't be rude.

236
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:16,720
Xi.

237
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,080
Mother.

238
00:16:20,280 --> 00:16:23,240
It was I who sent the benzoin
to Yan's room.

239
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:26,160
I'll accept any punishment.

240
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:30,080
Wanjun, don't hurt yourself.

241
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:32,920
Madam, Madam.

242
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:34,560
If you must blame someone, blame me.

243
00:16:34,880 --> 00:16:40,080
I approved the benzoin
and had the prescription sent over.

244
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:44,680
But I didn't know
they would be incompatible.

245
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:46,560
If you must punish someone,
punish me.

246
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:49,080
It's my fault for managing
the house poorly.

247
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:50,480
Alright, alright.

248
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,080
You haven't even been punished,

249
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:55,400
yet you've already started crying.

250
00:16:55,560 --> 00:16:58,400
Lady Qin, you're a bit too timid,
aren't you?

251
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,520
You truly are pitiable.

252
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:03,120
That's enough.

253
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:06,280
What will happen

254
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:09,040
if the two interact?

255
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:11,200
Used separately,
they're both good medicines.

256
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:14,040
But together, they are like oil on fire.

257
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:17,920
It'll lead to a chronic illness over time.

258
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,480
How odd!

259
00:17:19,600 --> 00:17:21,880
Before you even explained the danger,

260
00:17:22,120 --> 00:17:24,960
Lady Qin was already here,
making a whole scene.

261
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:26,040
Why is that?

262
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:29,240
She just gave herself away out of guilt.

263
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:31,400
-You…
-The plum drink was the same.

264
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:33,720
Each is harmless on their own,
but deadly when mixed.

265
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:37,920
And the poison was concealed the same way
the divination blocks were tampered with.

266
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:42,120
These events are all linked.

267
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:45,360
Who else could it be but you, Lady Qin?

268
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:49,240
No, not me, Master.

269
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:51,920
Master, I admit it. No, Master.

270
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:53,640
Master, Master. I… I admit it.

271
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:56,040
I admit to the benzoin and moxa.

272
00:17:56,440 --> 00:18:00,440
But the plum drink and the datura...
I had nothing to do with those!

273
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:03,720
-It really wasn't me!
-You have some nerve.

274
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:06,520
-To do such evil to your own child!
-No!

275
00:18:06,600 --> 00:18:08,600
-Father! Father!
-You evil woman!

276
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:11,320
-What else have you done? Speak!
-Father, please stop it!

277
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:12,920
-Father! Father!
-Speak up!

278
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:15,440
Mother was wrong,
but she doesn't deserve this.

279
00:18:15,760 --> 00:18:19,360
If she really had such a deep scheme,
how could she be exposed so easily?

280
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:23,640
She wouldn't dare pull something like that
under Madam Zhou's nose.

281
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,560
Madam Zhou is the lady of the house.

282
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:28,120
How could she…
How could she not have noticed?

283
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:39,080
You knew?

284
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:41,440
You knew all along!

285
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:44,400
You knew I wanted to take credit
before you did.

286
00:18:44,480 --> 00:18:48,600
You knew I saw your prescription,
but you pretended not to know it.

287
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:52,360
I thought you really gave up.

288
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:56,640
You used me to do your dirty work.
I'll kill you!

289
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:59,480
-What are you doing?
-Father! Father, stop it!

290
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,680
Get out of the way!

291
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:02,920
Mother! Mother!

292
00:19:04,760 --> 00:19:06,080
-Father.
-How dare you!

293
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:08,000
-Father! Father!
-I'll kill you!

294
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:12,440
-Father! Stop it!
-Stop it, Father! Stop it!

295
00:19:12,520 --> 00:19:14,440
Father, stop it!

296
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:15,920
Enough!

297
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:19,160
If you beat her to death,

298
00:19:19,240 --> 00:19:22,440
the Xie family would become
the laughingstock of Yangzhou.

299
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:24,840
Mother, she…

300
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:28,280
-I didn't.
-She was poisoning Yan.

301
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:32,160
And… And she dared to frame Wanjun.

302
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:35,880
She must be punished,

303
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:38,160
but it should be done by the rules.

304
00:19:38,760 --> 00:19:41,520
Qin Kehan, you'll receive
20 strokes of the cane

305
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:44,600
and be stripped
of your housekeeping rights.

306
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:48,120
Xie Qiao, Xie Xi.

307
00:19:48,560 --> 00:19:53,080
Your family ranks will be lowered from
Zhou and Hong to Hong and Huang.

308
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:57,480
Matron Fang, fetch a new set
of divination blocks.

309
00:19:57,560 --> 00:19:58,640
Yes.

310
00:19:58,760 --> 00:19:59,760
Elders of each branch.

311
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:02,840
Go back and put your own houses in order.

312
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:04,560
Wanjun.

313
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:07,600
-You stay.
-Mother.

314
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:09,760
I see your health has improved.

315
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:13,080
No more excuses
for not managing the household.

316
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:27,400
The Xie ancestral hall

317
00:20:36,040 --> 00:20:37,880
If your spirit is watching,

318
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:40,520
please bless him.

319
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:12,480
Congratulations, Madam.

320
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:14,080
Favorable cast all three times.

321
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:17,320
This is an auspicious sign.
Brighter days lie ahead.

322
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:20,120
I hope so.

323
00:21:22,200 --> 00:21:25,600
The ancestors have shown their will.

324
00:21:26,320 --> 00:21:28,520
Xie Yan has done great service
for the Xie family.

325
00:21:28,960 --> 00:21:32,800
His promotion is the will of Heaven.

326
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:34,520
It is beyond doubt.

327
00:21:48,960 --> 00:21:52,320
Xie Yan, you've made a great contribution.

328
00:21:52,520 --> 00:21:55,800
The family elders have reached
a consensus.

329
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:59,240
Your family rank will be promoted to Zhou.

330
00:22:00,040 --> 00:22:02,520
You'll oversee shipping.

331
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:04,240
Organize the grain ships,

332
00:22:04,560 --> 00:22:07,480
supervise the crews,
and take stock of the warehouses.

333
00:22:07,560 --> 00:22:09,320
You've just recovered from a long illness.

334
00:22:10,240 --> 00:22:12,040
You must not overexert yourself.

335
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:16,960
Once everything is in order,
we'll discuss whether you'll set sail.

336
00:22:17,800 --> 00:22:19,960
Now that you bear a responsibility,

337
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:22,920
you must always remember:

338
00:22:26,560 --> 00:22:28,640
The winds are high
and the waves are fierce.

339
00:22:29,840 --> 00:22:31,800
Be careful at every turn.

340
00:22:33,560 --> 00:22:36,000
The Xie family's ancestors

341
00:22:37,480 --> 00:22:40,280
Madam, let's go back first.

342
00:22:41,160 --> 00:22:42,640
Bring me the divination blocks.

343
00:23:04,080 --> 00:23:06,040
Ancestors,

344
00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:08,480
the family affairs are complicated.

345
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:10,840
It's hard to distinguish right from wrong.

346
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:14,160
What I see may not be the truth.

347
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:18,360
What I hear may not be the facts.

348
00:23:19,040 --> 00:23:21,480
Ancestors, please guide me.

349
00:23:22,080 --> 00:23:23,640
Show me the way.

350
00:23:48,360 --> 00:23:51,680
Saving lives and helping
the injured is what I strive for

351
00:23:53,560 --> 00:23:54,960
…as a physician.

352
00:23:55,560 --> 00:23:57,000
If you're really so noble,

353
00:23:57,520 --> 00:23:59,960
why would you come and wait on me?

354
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:02,760
You're just doing it for money.

355
00:24:03,120 --> 00:24:04,600
We're both from the countryside.

356
00:24:04,760 --> 00:24:06,360
Why are you so foolish?

357
00:24:06,720 --> 00:24:09,240
She's already helping her husband
make his mark.

358
00:24:09,320 --> 00:24:11,480
Yet you're still
sneaking around outside all day.

359
00:24:13,600 --> 00:24:15,120
Without the Xie family's recommendation,

360
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:18,040
you'd have to compete with thousands
for a single position.

361
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:21,480
You wouldn't stand a chance.
You'd be trampled to death.

362
00:24:21,560 --> 00:24:24,160
-I…
-Who wants to trample my son to death?

363
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:30,480
You almost ruined his handsome face.

364
00:24:30,640 --> 00:24:32,600
He almost ruined our whole family!

365
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:38,480
Do you have any idea how much money
he earned from the family funds?

366
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:39,960
Nine hundred taels!

367
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:49,440
I heard Xie Yan and Jin Baozhu pestered
the old matriarch for several nights.

368
00:24:49,520 --> 00:24:51,080
They even chipped in half themselves.

369
00:24:51,280 --> 00:24:52,960
And Jingxing didn't keep a penny.

370
00:24:53,640 --> 00:24:55,320
He put it all in your coffers.

371
00:24:58,120 --> 00:24:59,800
That much silver?

372
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:02,120
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

373
00:25:02,560 --> 00:25:04,280
You're as stupid as a donkey.

374
00:25:04,680 --> 00:25:06,360
You didn't give him a chance to speak.

375
00:25:06,800 --> 00:25:08,080
You're the donkey here.

376
00:25:09,400 --> 00:25:11,200
I'm going to check the storeroom.

377
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:28,240
Does it hurt?

378
00:25:30,520 --> 00:25:31,520
Do you hate me?

379
00:25:31,800 --> 00:25:32,800
No.

380
00:25:33,320 --> 00:25:34,480
If you don't hate me,

381
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:37,800
why did you have them
prepare that letter for you?

382
00:25:42,080 --> 00:25:43,360
My child has grown up.

383
00:25:43,760 --> 00:25:45,160
His wings have spread,

384
00:25:45,840 --> 00:25:47,280
and he wants to fly away.

385
00:25:50,480 --> 00:25:53,680
Do you really think
freedom comes that easily?

386
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:56,440
You were born into a lowly life.

387
00:25:56,880 --> 00:25:58,560
Your parents were both gamblers.

388
00:25:58,920 --> 00:26:02,760
They relied on your work at the pharmacy
to survive.

389
00:26:03,280 --> 00:26:06,000
Then, they somehow caught a plague

390
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,600
and died overnight.

391
00:26:07,840 --> 00:26:09,600
You were so small

392
00:26:09,920 --> 00:26:12,040
when you traveled all the way here.

393
00:26:12,360 --> 00:26:14,840
You happened to faint outside our gates.

394
00:26:15,120 --> 00:26:16,760
I took pity on you,

395
00:26:16,840 --> 00:26:19,240
and since you knew medicine,
I kindly took you in.

396
00:26:21,480 --> 00:26:22,480
But you…

397
00:26:23,040 --> 00:26:24,760
Your past is tainted.

398
00:26:25,240 --> 00:26:26,720
No one can help you.

399
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:31,400
You think I don't know
what you're thinking?

400
00:26:34,240 --> 00:26:37,480
She won't tolerate the slightest stain.

401
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:39,680
If she finds out

402
00:26:39,920 --> 00:26:41,840
about your tainted past,

403
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:43,400
what would she think?

404
00:26:46,320 --> 00:26:48,600
She'll avoid you like the plague.

405
00:26:54,840 --> 00:26:55,840
That's right.

406
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:58,440
Where else can you go now?

407
00:26:59,600 --> 00:27:01,840
You can only come to me.

408
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:08,040
I'm not going anywhere.

409
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:10,080
I'll stay right here.

410
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:21,320
Is this more of your sweet talk?

411
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:28,640
I know you dislike my uncle's lineage.

412
00:27:29,800 --> 00:27:32,360
I know showing care

413
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:34,400
is to gain their trust,

414
00:27:34,840 --> 00:27:36,480
so we can act when the time is right.

415
00:27:40,520 --> 00:27:42,080
I'll never betray you, Mother.

416
00:27:48,080 --> 00:27:49,440
At least you're sensible.

417
00:28:07,360 --> 00:28:12,320
Your father looks mild-mannered,
but he's terrifying when he hits someone.

418
00:28:12,720 --> 00:28:14,640
Everyone has a side that you don't see.

419
00:28:19,040 --> 00:28:20,040
Is it done?

420
00:28:22,200 --> 00:28:23,200
Let me see.

421
00:28:35,120 --> 00:28:38,000
Then what is that side of you like?

422
00:28:39,480 --> 00:28:41,560
Young Master! Young Master! Young…

423
00:28:49,320 --> 00:28:52,440
Young Master, I've looked into the matter
you asked about.

424
00:28:53,880 --> 00:28:55,120
First Master manages the docks.

425
00:28:55,320 --> 00:28:57,560
Fifth Young Master worked
under him previously.

426
00:28:57,720 --> 00:29:00,120
The stewards and accountants
were all slippery old-timers.

427
00:29:00,520 --> 00:29:01,840
Now that you're taking over,

428
00:29:02,240 --> 00:29:03,480
I'm afraid they'll cause trouble.

429
00:29:05,200 --> 00:29:06,600
We'll go and see tomorrow.

430
00:29:07,160 --> 00:29:08,480
-Yes.
-I can manage accounts, too.

431
00:29:08,560 --> 00:29:09,560
Take me with you.

432
00:29:10,240 --> 00:29:12,920
You… Just stay home and be good.

433
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:15,000
Be good?

434
00:29:15,280 --> 00:29:17,440
Only cats and dogs need to be good.
I'm a human.

435
00:29:17,520 --> 00:29:19,680
Besides, the ladies of the Xie family
all have proper ranks.

436
00:29:20,040 --> 00:29:22,480
I've done so much for the family.
Why don't I have one?

437
00:29:22,680 --> 00:29:24,560
Isn't Xie Xi's rank vacant now?

438
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:26,320
I've asked Grandmother about it.

439
00:29:26,800 --> 00:29:28,520
What she said makes sense.

440
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:32,640
Xie Xi's rank is indeed vacant,
but holding onto it is no easy task.

441
00:29:32,800 --> 00:29:34,400
You'd have to manage several shops.

442
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:36,400
Though it's all business,

443
00:29:36,600 --> 00:29:38,560
they're dozens of times larger
than your butcher shop.

444
00:29:38,720 --> 00:29:40,320
Hundreds of people come and go daily.

445
00:29:40,560 --> 00:29:41,640
Can you handle it?

446
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:43,240
I can learn.

447
00:29:44,040 --> 00:29:45,880
The shops are vital
to the Xie family's revenue.

448
00:29:46,520 --> 00:29:47,960
They are our foundation.

449
00:29:48,080 --> 00:29:49,440
I'm a fast learner.

450
00:29:49,520 --> 00:29:51,440
I know you're smart, but…

451
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:55,920
Just a few days ago,
you were almost murdered.

452
00:29:56,520 --> 00:29:57,640
How can I not worry?

453
00:29:57,880 --> 00:29:59,880
I'll just be more careful then.

454
00:29:59,960 --> 00:30:01,040
You're so naggy.

455
00:30:01,120 --> 00:30:02,240
Why won't you listen?

456
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:04,600
A noble house is like these roses.

457
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:07,160
They look beautiful,
but they're fed by rotting flesh.

458
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,440
One wrong step,

459
00:30:08,560 --> 00:30:10,280
and you'll become a fertilizer.

460
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:11,400
But I'm not afraid.

461
00:30:11,800 --> 00:30:12,800
You're not afraid?

462
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:14,720
But Yingtao is.

463
00:30:22,040 --> 00:30:23,240
I'm not blaming you.

464
00:30:25,320 --> 00:30:26,800
Even if you aren't afraid, I am.

465
00:30:31,880 --> 00:30:33,000
You stay right here.

466
00:30:33,840 --> 00:30:35,240
Don't take a single step out.
